{"id":57489,"date":"2026-08-07T10:23:30","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T09:23:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57489"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:37:56","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:37:56","slug":"night-run-pegoes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/night-run-pegoes\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00aa Night Run Peg\u00f5es 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00aa Night Run Peg\u00f5es 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>1\u00aa Night Run Peg\u00f5es 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no in\u00edcio da noite de s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na acolhedora vila de <strong>Peg\u00f5es<\/strong>, no concelho do Montijo, distrito de Set\u00fabal. Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o para a Forma\u00e7\u00e3o e Desenvolvimento Desportivo (AFDD)<\/strong> em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal do Montijo e a Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Peg\u00f5es e Santo Isidro de Peg\u00f5es, a prova comemora o anivers\u00e1rio da freguesia com uma festa noturna de desporto e conv\u00edvio comunit\u00e1rio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada instaladas junto \u00e0 <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Peg\u00f5es<\/strong>, o evento percorre estradas e caminhos rurais com recurso obrigat\u00f3rio a luz frontal, integrando a <strong>Corrida Noturna de 10 km<\/strong> (18h10), a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (18h15) e a <strong>Kids Race de 400m<\/strong> (18h00). Os atletas usufruem de dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica Acorrer, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos aos 5km e meta, balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes na Escola EB 2,3, medalha finisher e op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar conv\u00edvio tradicional.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 